    {
      "id": "claim_f3bda332073f48709e1207ba1508eaf5",
      "statement": "For each item, reserve() selects the product row with FOR UPDATE. If the SKU does not exist, it returns 404. If available stock is less than the requested quantity, it returns 409. Otherwise it decrements available and accumulates the subtotal with authoritative prices from the database.",
